@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai -> 201 + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"}

### 5. Doc lai (gui request 4 truoc) -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Du lieu rong -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"}

### 9. Tai nguyen cha khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"}

### 10. Sai kieu noi dung -> 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"}

### 11. JSON hong -> 400 framework
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001",

### 12. Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001"}

### 13. Sai phuong thuc -> 405
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 14. Khong khop route -> 404 body rong
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc
